                                "sense_id": "76d8accd-b2a7-31a8-892b-571b3565476c",
                                "text": "1974, Vladimir Nabokov, Look at the Harlequins!, http://books.google.com/books?id=2EmDMVHZ1oIC&pg=PT232&dq=%22nosewing%22&hl=en&sa=X&ei=tSbsUO6aEM3kqAG884Fg&ved=0CEYQ6AEwBDgK\nA furrow sloped down from each nosewing, and a jowl pouch on each side of my chin formed in three-quarterface the banal flexure common to old men of all races, classes, and professions."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ced7c53d-3f74-4ff6-938a-fd8f0a745b99",
                                "sense_id": "76d8accd-b2a7-31a8-892b-571b3565476c",
                                "text": "Eliza laughed slyly, passing her finger under her wide nosewing."
